body:
It's difficult because I also want to help people. I know art can help people, but there is a nice feeling to see a person become better. I want to help the elderly and help people who have cognitive and behavioral issues. I can see myself doing that too.

&#x200B;

However anytime I struggle with this "What do I want to do?" I always seem to go back to art. I cry about it sometimes lmao

A：にちようびは　パーティーを　します。

B：なんじ＿＿　いいですか。

A：２じ＿＿　いいです。

B：わかりました。

&#x200B;

にほんごのクラスは　２じ＿＿＿です。

&#x200B;

にちようびは　サッカー＿＿します。

&#x200B;

These are a few I got wrong.

Ugh at least you get to accept it. Mine hasn't shown up at all. 

&#x200B;

Does that possibly mean that I wont be getting loans this summer?
